          <comment>Tyrant. When this unit loses it&apos;s last model outside any Morale Phase, and a CONTROL-LINK BIOFORM is on the Battlefield, you can return the unit at Starting Strength to the battlefield as reinforcements.</comment>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">When this unit loses it&apos;s last model outside any Morale Phase, and a CONTROL-LINK BIOFORM is on the Battlefield, roll a D6, on a 2+, you can return the unit at Starting Strength to the battlefield as reinforcements. While a friendly HIVE TYRANT model is on the battlefield, do no roll a dice, the check is considered to be successfull.
