            <characteristic name="Details" typeId="ad96-dfa4-b4ed-656d">Details: Blessing: Symbiostorm has a warp charge value of 7. If manifested, select one friendly KRONOS unit withinSynapse range of this PSYKER. Until the start of your next Psychic phase, each time a model in that unit makes a ranged attack, add 1 to the Strength characteristic of that attack.</characteristic>
