            <characteristic name="Warp Charge" typeId="5ffd-b800-c317-532a">6</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Range" typeId="fd64-cbc4-94de-24cc">18&quot; or Synapse</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Details" typeId="ad96-dfa4-b4ed-656d">Details: Witchfire: Psychic Shriek has a warp charge value of 6. If manifested, select one enemy unit within Synapse range of this PSYKER or one enemy unit within 18&quot; of this PSYKER. Roll one D6 for each friendly HYDRA INFANTRY and HYDRA BEAST model within 3&quot; of that unit and three D6s for each friendly HYDRA MONSTER model within 3&quot; of that unit: for each 5+, that enemy unit suffers 1 mortal wound (to a maximum of 6 mortal wounds).</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="true">
              <conditionGroups>
