  <rules>
    <rule name="Diverse bioforms" id="a3ff-57a9-1616-cc86" hidden="false">
      <description>Due Lore restrictions, Tyranid armies should consist in multitude of diferent bioforms, being the smallest of them the most numerous.
Due this, some restrictions have been placed for army building to reflect that trait.
Tyranid Bioforms have been sorted in 6 separate classes.
- Control-Link (mainly HQ units with the SYNAPSE ability), that don&apos;t have any restriction.
- Minor Bioforms (units that should be the main bulk of the Tyranid Army)
- Common Bioforms
- Assault Bioforms
- Specialized Bioforms
- Hyper-specialized Bioforms</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Tyranids: Bioforms (Crusade)" id="1ee8-bc80-2e95-16ca" hidden="false">
      <description>Each time a Minor, Common or Assault Bioform unit is destroyed in battle, at the end of the battle, that unit is considered destroyed, but it may be kept in the Order of Battle as if a new unit had been added., losing all it&apos;s Experience points, Battle Honours and Battle Scars, and it&apos;s Combat tallies are reset.</description>
    </rule>
  </rules>
