        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While a friendly &lt;HIVE FLEET&gt; unit is within 6&quot; of this unit, that unit automatically passes Morale tests. Synapse range cannot be increased over 12&quot;.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
      <modifierGroups>
        <modifierGroup type="and">
          <conditions>
            <condition childId="1b0d-b129-a9fd-6281" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="equalTo" value="1"/>
          </conditions>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228" type="set" value="While a friendly LEVIATHAN unit is within 6&quot; of this unit, that unit automatically passes Morale tests. Synapse range cannot be increased over 12&quot;."/>
            <modifier field="name" type="set" value="Synapse (9&quot;) [Aura]"/>
          </modifiers>
        </modifierGroup>
      </modifierGroups>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Shadow in the Warp [Aura]" id="5d5d-f5e2-f9b2-2e9e" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While an enemy PSYKER unit is within 18&quot; of this unit:
- Subtract 1 from Psychic tests taken for that enemy unit.
- Each time that enemy unit suffers Perils of the Warp, it suffers 1 additional mortal wound.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Psychic Barrier" id="4df3-ec98-814b-7ebc" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">This model has a 4+ invulnerable save.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Prehensile pincer tail" id="905e-48c6-12e5-35cf" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time the bearer is selected to fight, when resolving its attacks you can re-roll one hit roll or one wound roll.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Biostatic rattle" id="1c79-1ac7-5386-bdb4" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">At the start of the Fight phase, select one enemy unit within Engagement Range of the bearer. Roll 2D6: if the result is greater than the enemy unit’s Leadership characteristic, until the end of the phase, each time a model in that unit makes an attack, that attack’s hit roll cannot be re-rolled and that attack’s wound roll cannot be re-rolled.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Lash Whip" id="63cd-2afc-b384-ca4d" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time the bearer makes a melee attack, re-roll a hit roll of 1.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Hive Mind&apos;s avatar" id="d0f6-f21e-4168-7496" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">If the WARLORD is slain during the battle, you can select one unit with this ability, and randomly determine an aviable Warlord trait for it (unless it have a mandated Warlord trait). That unit is not considered a WARLORD, except for the use of this ability.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Floating Death" id="4498-ad0f-809d-9317" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time a model in this unit ends a move within 3&quot; of any enemy units, or an enemy unit ends a move during which any of its models moved within 3&quot; of a model from this unit, that model can explode. Select one of those enemy units and make attacks with the ranged weapons of the model as if were in your Shooting phase.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Symbiotic Targeting" id="743b-98ed-5f27-d7a9" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">In your Movement phase, if this model Remains Stationary or moves a total distance of less than half its Move characteristic, until the end of the turn, each time this model makes a ranged attack, the target does not receive the benefits of cover against that attack.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Manoeuvrable" id="62b2-530b-a9d4-f875" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time this model makes a Normal Move, Advances or Falls Back, first pivot it on the spot up to 90° (this does not contribute to how far the model moves), then move the model straight forwards. It can pivot up to 90° one more time, at any point, during the move.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Hunter&apos;s Instincts" id="bd25-5a20-e99d-ae0d" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time this model makes an attack against a unit that can FLY, add 1 to that attack’s hit roll.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Hover" id="5d01-518d-6370-10d9" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">In your Command phase, this model can hover. If it does so, then until the start of your next Command phase, its Move characteristic becomes 15&quot; and it loses the Airborne, Hard to Hit and Manoeuvrable abilities.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Synapse (9&quot;) [Aura]" id="c18d-26ba-c1b0-39b0" hidden="false" noindex="true" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While a friendly &lt;HIVE FLEET&gt; unit is within 9&quot; of this unit, that unit automatically passes Morale tests. Synapse range cannot be increased over 12&quot;.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
      <modifierGroups>
        <modifierGroup type="and">
          <conditions>
            <condition childId="1b0d-b129-a9fd-6281" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="equalTo" value="1"/>
          </conditions>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228" type="set" value="While a friendly LEVIATHAN unit is within 12&quot; of this unit, that unit automatically passes Morale tests. Synapse range cannot be increased over 12&quot;."/>
            <modifier field="name" type="set" value="Synapse (12&quot;) [Aura]"/>
          </modifiers>
        </modifierGroup>
      </modifierGroups>
    </profile>
  </sharedProfiles>
  <sharedRules>
    <rule name="Death Throes" id="a30d-0f5b-9536-c41e" hidden="false">
      <description>When this model is destroyed, roll one D6 before removing it from play. On a 6+, the closest enemy unit within 6&quot; suffers D3 mortal wounds.</description>
    </rule>
  </sharedRules>
  <sharedSelectionEntries>
