                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- You can re-roll Deny the Witch tests taken for units with this adaptation.
- Each time a Psychic power is manifested by a unit with this adaptation, increase the range of that Psychic power by 3&quot; (if that Psychic power specifies multiple ranges, add 3&quot; to the first range specified in that Psychic power only).</characteristic>
                      </characteristics>
