    <selectionEntry name=" Synaptic Imperatives" id="2763-5bb5-dcb4-e950" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
      <constraints>
        <constraint id="6b8b-519c-699b-da3a" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
        <constraint id="f8d9-053a-f393-2d53" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="force" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
        <constraint id="70ff-f42d-e175-2429" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="force" shared="true" type="min" value="1"/>
      </constraints>
      <costs>
        <cost name="PL" typeId="e356-c769-5920-6e14" value="0"/>
        <cost name="CP" typeId="2d3b-b544-ad49-fb75" value="0"/>
        <cost name="Pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
        <cost name="RP" typeId="ed03-25cc-2681-bdce" value="0"/>
      </costs>
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Relentless Ferocity (Hive Tyrant)" id="9710-a0a6-a7b6-56c3" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While this Synaptic Imperative ability is active for your army and a friendly &lt;HIVE FLEET&gt; unit is within SYNAPSE range of a CONTROL-LINK BIOFORM model, that unit is eligible to declare a charge in a turn in which it Fell Back.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="true">
              <conditions>
                <condition childId="ca2a-d819-4e38-8cc7" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="force" shared="true" type="equalTo" value="0"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
        </profile>
        <profile name=" Synaptic Imperatives" id="c1b4-d076-d71e-5e1f" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">At the start of the battle round, you can select one of the Synaptic Imperative abilities from a unit from your army. You cannot select a unit’s Synaptic Imperative ability if that unit is not on the battlefield. Until the end of the battle round, that Synaptic Imperative ability is active for your army, and it is gained by each of the CONTROL-LINK BIOFORM models from your army.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Predatory Guile (Broodlord)" id="0760-aaca-86c4-6555" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While this Synaptic Imperative ability is active for your army and a friendly &lt;HIVE FLEET&gt; SWARM or BEAST unit is within SYNAPSE range of a CONTROL-LINK BIOFORM, each time an attack targets that unit, that unit is treated as having the benefits of Light Cover against that attack. If that unit was already receiving the benefits of Light Cover against that attack, it is treated as also having the benefits of Heavy Cover against that attack.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="true">
              <conditions>
                <condition childId="c5cc-933d-aa72-ae12" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="force" shared="true" type="equalTo" value="0"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Psychic Augmentation (Neurothrope)" id="30ed-5614-ab0f-9c12" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While this Synaptic Imperative ability is active for your army and a friendly &lt;HIVE FLEET&gt; unit is within SYNAPSE range of a CONTROL-LINK BIOFORM model:
- Add 1 to Psychic tests taken for that unit.
- Add 1 to Deny the Witch tests taken for that unit.
- Each time a model in that unit would lose a wound as the result of a mortal wound, roll one D6: on a 5+, that wound is not lost.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="true">
              <conditions>
                <condition childId="85c9-6ac1-7da6-1b04" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="force" shared="true" type="equalTo" value="0"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Thrashing Demise (Trygon Prime)" id="8f2d-805b-8b51-a120" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While this Synaptic Imperative ability is active for your army and a friendly &lt;HIVE FLEET&gt; unit is within SYNAPSE range of a CONTROL-LINK BIOFORM model:
- Each time you roll a dice for the Death Throes rule of a model in that unit, add 3 to the roll.
- Each time a model is destroyed in that unit as a result of a melee attack, if that model does not have the Death Throes rule, roll one D6: on a 6, the attacking model’s unit suffers 1 mortal wound after making all of its attacks.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="true">
              <conditions>
                <condition childId="cffa-b24d-bbd4-9275" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="force" shared="true" type="equalTo" value="0"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Psychic Oversight (Malanthrope)" id="94fe-b8b3-f666-a1f9" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While this Synaptic Imperative ability is active for your army and a friendly &lt;HIVE FLEET&gt; unit is within SYNAPSE range of a CONTROL-LINK BIOFORM model:
- If that unit is performing an action, it can make ranged attacks without that action failing.
- That unit can start to perform an action, even if it Advanced or Fell Back this turn.
- If that unit has the PSYKER keyword, performing a psychic action does not prevent it from manifesting psychic powers.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="true">
              <conditions>
                <condition childId="b751-07e4-d160-8fce" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="force" shared="true" type="equalTo" value="0"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Surgin Vitality (Tervigon)" id="4666-e84c-a201-96df" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While this Synaptic Imperative ability is active for your army and a friendly &lt;HIVE FLEET&gt; unit is within SYNAPSE range of a CONTROL-LINK BIOFORM model, each time that unit is selected to make a Normal Move or Advance, until the end of the phase, add 2&quot; to the Move characteristic of models in that unit.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="true">
              <conditions>
                <condition childId="07db-07d4-025a-4f15" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="force" shared="true" type="equalTo" value="0"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
