        <profile name="Diffusion Field [Aura]" id="065d-1624-9400-f297" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While a friendly &lt;HIVE FLEET&gt; unit is within 6&quot; of this PSYKER, if in your previous Psychic phase this model didn&apos;t use any Psychic Powers, each time a ranged attack is made against that unit, subtract 1 from the Strength characteristic of that attack.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Psychic Overload" id="5c01-a4f5-6eb5-dde8" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time this model successfully manifests a psychic power or completes a psychic action, if the result of the Psychic test was 7 or more, after resolving that psychic power, the closest enemy unit within 12&quot; suffers one mortal wound.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
