            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">When this model from is set up on the battlefield using its Death From Below ability, you can select one friendly &lt;HIVE FLEET&gt; unit without MONSTER Keyword that is in Strategic Reserves. 
