      <profiles>
        <profile name="Seed Spore Mines [Action]" id="69d6-3992-3617-216e" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">At the start of your Shooting phase, one BIOVORES unit from your army can start to perform this action. The action is completed at the end of that phase. 
When it is completed, set up a new friendly SPORE MINES unit of the type the unit has the launcher equipped on the battlefield, more than 6&quot; away from any enemy units and:
- If equipped with SPORE MINES, wholly within 48&quot; of this unit.
- If equipped with MEIOTIC SPORE MINES, wholly within 36&quot; of this unit.
- If equipped with MUCOLID SPORE MINES, wholly within 24&quot; of this unit.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
