        <profile name="Seed Spores [Action]" id="c9f0-f2de-a22d-99ba" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">At the start of your Movement phase, any number of SPOROCYST models from your army can start to perform this action. The action is completed at the end of that phase. When it is completed, set up a new friendly SPORE MINES unit containing 3 models or a new friendly MUCOLID SPORES unit containing 1 model on the battlefield. That unit must be set up more than 6&quot; away from any enemy units and wholly within 18&quot; of this model.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
