                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">In your Command phase, select one friendly JORMUNGANDR unit within Synaptic Link range of this WARLORD. Until the start of your next Command phase, each time a model in that unit makes an attack, the target does not receive the benefits of cover against that attack.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
