                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While an enemy PSYKER unit is within 18&quot; of this WARLORD, each time a Psychic test is taken for that unit, it suffers Perils of the Warp on any dice roll that includes a double, instead of only a double 1 or double 6.</characteristic>
