            <profile name="Bursting the Sac [Action]" id="cb30-dd55-8d97-aa7a" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">At the start of your Shooting phase, this model can start to perform this action. The action is completed at the end of your next Movement phase. When it is completed, set up a new &lt;HIVE FLEET&gt; RIPPER SWARMS unit on the battlefield within 3&quot; of this model and not within Engagement Range of any enemy units. That RIPPER SWARMS unit contains D3+2 models, and, if you are playing a game that uses a points limit, does not cost any Reinforcement points.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
        </selectionEntry>
