            <profile name="Preceptic Node" id="be11-437b-da23-f666" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">In the Reinforcements step of your opponent’s Movement phase, each time an enemy unit is set up as Reinforcements within 18&quot; of the bearer, you can select one friendly LEVIATHAN CORE or LEVIATHAN CHARACTER unit within 6&quot; of the bearer. If you do so, that friendly unit can shoot as if it were your Shooting phase, but its models can only target that enemy Reinforcements unit. A unit cannot be selected to fire more than once per phase as a result of this Relic.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
        </selectionEntry>
